    "items": [
      "Every row except the acolytes takes `Stats` from a template and ends at `EncDragonPriest` 023A93 (level 50), directly or through `EncDragonPriestFire` 02025A · `…Frost` 02025B · `…Shock` 02025C and the `…AmbushSarcFire` 08A1C8 · `…Frost` 0480B9 · `…Shock` 08A1C9 copies. None of the eight Skyrim priests or Vahlok sets `BaseData`, so each keeps its own name.",
      "Changing `EncDragonPriest` moves every row but the acolytes at once, plus the summoned `SummonEncDragonPriest` 10FC15 (on Conjured → *Heroes & Spirits*), the unplaced `EncDragonPriestStaff` 08DC3E, and the CC Ayleid liches `ccBGSSSE067_AyleidLichBossAmbush` 000B73 and `ccBGSSSE067_ConjureEncAyleidLich` 147D97:ccbgssse067-daedinv.esm (Norion the Undying, on Undead → *Ayleid Undead (CC)*).",
      "The three acolytes have no template; no other record follows them."
    ]
